@startuml
hide empty members
' yangzhou.persistence — schema 实体概念图(V1__core.sql + V2__workflow.sql)
' 只画领域字段;infra(id/objectId/createdAt/updatedAt/passwordHash/lastItemNumber)不画;
' parentId 不画,反转为父侧 children(List)。真相源是 Flyway schema:改表必须同步此图(AGENTS.md「类图」)。
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Workspace {
  name: String
}
class Member {
  username: String
  displayName: String
}
class AttributeDefinition {
  name: String
  kind: String
  leveled: Boolean
}
class Capability {
  level: Int?
}
class Project {
  key: String
  name: String
}
class Status {
  name: String
  icon: String?
  isFinal: Boolean
  position: Int
}
class StatusTransition
class Item {
  number: Int
  title: String
  description: String?
  type: String
  children: List<Item>
}
class Requirement {
  minLevel: Int?
}

Workspace "1" *-- "*" Member : 目录
Workspace "1" *-- "*" AttributeDefinition : 词表
Workspace "1" *-- "*" Project

Member "1" *-- "*" Capability
Capability "*" *-- "1" AttributeDefinition

Project "1" *-- "*" Item : 编号序列
Project "1" *-- "*" Status
Project "1" *-- "*" StatusTransition

Item "父 0..1" o-- "children *" Item : 同质树(防环)

Item "*" *-- "1" Status : 当前状态
Item "1" *-- "*" Requirement
Requirement "*" *-- "1" AttributeDefinition

StatusTransition "*" --> "from 1" Status
StatusTransition "*" --> "to 1" Status

note bottom of StatusTransition
  迁移表无行 = 自由迁移(V1 默认);
  有行 = 仅列出的 from→to 合法。
end note
note right of Item
  number 为项目内递增编号,
  对外展示为 "{key}-{number}"(如 CHE-1)。
  type ∈ {task, bug, goal, story}。
end note
@enduml
